    "title": "Makeup ASMR: Makeover Story",
    "description": "Imagine transforming a rotting mermaid into an enchanting human.\r\nHow to turn a scruffy beggar into a handsome man?\r\nHave flies or bees ever invaded your eyes?\r\nCan you still kiss your girlfriend with cracked lips?\r\n\r\nDon't worry, we have the answers! But we offer much more\u2014\r\n\r\nFeatures:\r\n1. Immersive care for your ears, armpits, lips, and hair, providing holistic stress relief!\r\n\r\n2. Sound effects for unmatched relaxation and serenity, leaving behind worries for a stress-free beautification experience!\r\n\r\n3. Diverse character roles for endless outfit possibilities. Create a unique style with clothing, hairstyles, and accessories!\r\n\r\n4. Challenging organizing and tidying games await. Unlock levels and discover additional surprises!",
